      <h3>Tips for Finding an Appointment Quickly</h3>
      <ul style="margin: 10px 0 16px 20px; line-height: 2;">
        <li>Check at <strong>midnight to 1am</strong> — many provinces release new slots at this time</li>
        <li>Check early on <strong>Monday morning</strong> when weekend cancellations free up slots</li>
        <li>Try <strong>smaller offices within your province</strong> if the main city is fully booked</li>
        <li>Set up a browser alert or use a notification service to ping you when slots appear</li>
        <li>If nothing is available, try checking <strong>2–3 months ahead</strong> — some provinces load slots this far in advance</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="msv-box msv-box-red">
